+## Independent referee check (disjoint method, by this office)
+
+Verified independently of the researcher, from primary arithmetic and the repo docs:
+- `12! = 479001600`; `2^29 = 536870912`; `2^28 < 12! < 2^29`, so
+  `ceil(log2 12!) = 29`; `12!/2^29 = 0.89221` (matches Stober–Weiß Table 2 `E_tot`).
+- `C(12,2) = 66` = number of first-level comparisons from the antichain (consistent
+  with the reported `|S_1|=66`).
+- The "no compact certificate known; only exhaustive search" claim is consistent with
+  `docs/research-plan.md` ("Can the n=12 obstruction be explained by an invariant that
+  generalizes?") and `docs/research-obstruction-next.md` §3–§6, which document the
+  falsified scalar hypotheses and list the human-readable certificate as `[open]`.
+- These checks establish the *negative/inconclusive* status, not any positive theorem.
+  The researcher proved no impossibility theorem for all certificate classes and made
+  no completion claim.
